Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： HSQ-Rip
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕時間軸由kewenyu調整以適應當前作品
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.93,0:00:08.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我女兒的墓碑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:10.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不落下焚毀就無法改變世界
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:14.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,女兒？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:15.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:17.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何還不醒悟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:22.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對我們調整者來說
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:26.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,派翠克·薩拉所走的道路才是唯一的正途
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:44.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:46.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,降落程式 第二階段
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.51,0:00:48.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse和他的Zaku呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.51,0:00:51.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 無法確認位置
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:52.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.94,0:00:57.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的意志 這次定要讓自然人們嘗嘗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.34,0:03:07.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即將進入第三階段
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.05,0:03:10.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經到達開火的極限 艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:12.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是Impulse和Zaku的位置還...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.18,0:03:15.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不確定的話 容易殃及
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:17.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:22.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,陽電子炮啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:31.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阻止Junius7墜落是無論如何都必須完成的任務
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.01,0:03:34.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瞄準 右舷前方結構
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:38.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,陽電子炮瞄準 右舷前方結構
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:46.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:58.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,調整入射角 耐熱系統正常
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.52,0:04:01.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自動姿態控制系統啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:03.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ECS設置為中性
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.15,0:04:07.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.28,0:04:22.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為損傷機體右腳溫度上升太快 能行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:23.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:40.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進入第三階段
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.81,0:04:51.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:57.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重複一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:05:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Junius7的粉碎作業雖成功完成
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.72,0:05:03.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但現在仍有受殘骸襲擊的威脅
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:07.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,殘骸的墜落地點至今無法探明
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:10.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請立即前往政府指定的避難所避難
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:16.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了 要死的話也想死在自己家裏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:18.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,母親你說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:22.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏已經人滿為患
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:25.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請前往第32號避難所
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.59,0:05:29.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,據預測赤道附近地區最為危險
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.91,0:05:32.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,住在沿海地區的市民請盡可能遠離海邊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.87,0:05:34.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到高處避難
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.59,0:05:36.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.37,0:05:37.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.45,0:05:44.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼來了 什麼來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.59,0:05:46.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,得一直呆在這裏嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.45,0:05:51.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 聽好了 就一會兒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:53.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:05:58.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.45,0:06:00.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.16,0:06:03.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:06:59.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會死嗎 都會死嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.71,0:08:01.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 可以進行空氣動力控制了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.17,0:08:04.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主翼展開 操縱時別慌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:07.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主翼展開 轉為大氣層內推進狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.40,0:08:12.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通信和探測器情況如何
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:16.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 受殘骸落下影響電波狀況不良
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.66,0:08:18.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,鐳射和熱感知也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:20.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕緊找到Impulse和Zaku
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.84,0:08:24.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你認為他們也能安全降落？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.43,0:08:29.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也許你會問我發射陽電子炮時怎麼沒想到他們
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:32.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,寧可相信
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.96,0:08:44.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然沒有加速器的話大氣層裏...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.89,0:08:47.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.51,0:08:48.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 是你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.79,0:08:50.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 我這就來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.26,0:08:52.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別來 就算是Impulse的加速器
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:08:54.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,兩台機體墜落的動能...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.74,0:09:01.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你為什麼總是說這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.92,0:09:03.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那你想讓我說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.39,0:09:06.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,諸如「你這傢伙還不快救我！」之類
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:09.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想聽這種話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.06,0:09:12.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 只是打個比方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.42,0:09:14.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,探測器反應
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:16.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,七點方向 距離400
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.98,0:09:17.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.71,0:09:20.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse 不...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:22.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能顯示光學影像嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.71,0:09:24.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 請稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:28.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Zaku也沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.10,0:09:30.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:33.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,亞瑟 用燈光信號傳達
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:34.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:36.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,麥克 把船靠過去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.60,0:09:40.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不趕快接住的話那樣遲早會撞上海面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.07,0:09:52.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse和Zaku著艦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:01.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.31,0:10:09.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 又怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:14.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,環繞地球一周的最初墜落衝擊波 應該是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:32.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,羅馬 上海 戈壁沙漠 魁北克
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:36.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,費城和大西洋北部
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:41.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知死亡人數會上升到多少 實在可憐可歎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.28,0:10:46.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今後才是真正的非常時期
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.84,0:10:56.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對角良好 放下襟翼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:02.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,輸入測定的海面風速
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.82,0:11:06.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,入水檢查單1號到24號全部正常
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.19,0:11:12.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,震動效果超過模擬值
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.70,0:11:13.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去輔助
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.64,0:11:18.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,警報 全員防備入水時的衝擊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:42.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,入水完成 警報解除
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.91,0:11:46.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在全部區域未發現進水情況
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.78,0:11:48.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今後也要多加注意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.97,0:11:51.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,損管隊員到下部區域
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.42,0:11:59.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.67,0:12:03.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是降落到一個叫太平洋的海洋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:05.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.78,0:12:10.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,虧你還有閒心說這些 怎麼總這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.82,0:12:13.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:15.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.37,0:12:20.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真吃了一驚 可為你擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.10,0:12:23.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道你會駕駛MS出去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:26.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 自作主張
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:28.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼 別管這些了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:30.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也知道你的技術
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:35.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我反而慶倖有你出去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.37,0:12:41.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次可鬧大了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.92,0:12:43.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但多虧密涅瓦和伊紮克他們的努力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:46.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,損失減少了許多
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.23,0:12:49.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望地球人也能知道這些事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.99,0:12:51.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夠了 傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.79,0:12:54.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.87,0:12:56.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是也在艦橋嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.36,0:12:59.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那應該知道這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.74,0:13:01.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:04.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Junius7的墜落並非自然現象
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.61,0:13:09.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有犯人在 推它下來的是調整者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.53,0:13:12.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們的家人在那裏被殺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:14.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,仍然為此懷恨在心的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.91,0:13:17.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想扔它下去毀滅自然人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.26,0:13:46.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然知道 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.22,0:13:47.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:51.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們不是拼命努力阻止他們了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:52.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.22,0:13:59.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但殘骸還是墜落了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.28,0:14:10.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們沒能完全阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:12.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.36,0:14:32.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使只是一部分人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.81,0:14:36.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但還是我們調整者所為
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:43.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣還能原諒我們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.97,0:14:55.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個帶頭的傢伙最後說了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.70,0:14:59.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對我們調整者來說
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.94,0:15:03.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,派翠克·薩拉所走的道路才是唯一的正途
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.07,0:15:21.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:24.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是什麼也不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.93,0:15:34.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個人太可憐了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:44.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT也對這前所未聞的慘劇深表遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.66,0:15:51.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各地慘不忍睹的景象也令我啞口無言
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.93,0:15:57.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀呀 還是損失不小啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.07,0:16:01.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,派特農神廟被炸飛了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.42,0:16:04.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那種老舊的建築
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.60,0:16:07.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有與沒有不會改變任何事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.12,0:16:10.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,打算怎麼辦 吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.55,0:16:15.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道這已造成深刻的傷痕和無盡的悲哀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:18.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但地球的朋友們
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.55,0:16:22.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請從這絕望的一日中站起來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.36,0:16:25.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在超越大家想像的苦難面前
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.92,0:16:28.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也將不惜一切伸出援手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.97,0:16:32.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,狄蘭達爾的行動很快
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.66,0:16:35.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙 一邊花言巧語
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.84,0:16:38.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一邊已經開始做事了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:42.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我想已經傳到大家手上了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:47.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PhantomPaine部隊發來了非常有趣的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.87,0:16:50.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:52.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂 什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.75,0:16:54.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,耀斑馬達？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.27,0:16:58.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 到頭來是這麼一回事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.61,0:17:00.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,令人意想不到的王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.71,0:17:05.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這世上不可能有人能饒恕這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.51,0:17:10.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而這將會成為我們之間最重要的紐帶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.90,0:17:15.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次要賜予他們所有人死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.75,0:17:19.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了藍色清淨的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:28.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何還不醒悟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.23,0:17:33.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對我們調整者來說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.36,0:17:37.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,派翠克·薩拉所走的道路才是唯一的正途
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.85,0:17:47.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:51.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,粉塵濃度太高 現在鐳射通信也不通
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.50,0:17:53.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.72,0:17:54.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.21,0:18:05.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦船檢查和各部門應急處理完成後
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.83,0:18:08.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,將會前往奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.67,0:18:10.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 明白
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.35,0:18:13.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在才從這裏說起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.28,0:18:16.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也沒什麼意義了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.59,0:18:17.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然我知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.13,0:18:21.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為奧布是島國
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.01,0:18:23.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,擔心也是正常的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:30.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本打算抵達後儘量為密涅瓦提供方便
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.59,0:18:33.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,借此感謝你們的勇氣和功績
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:36.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣一來我也不能隨便保證了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.43,0:18:39.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原諒我 艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.69,0:18:41.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不敢當
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.21,0:19:04.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,例行訓練日嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.72,0:19:05.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:08.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是外面空氣比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.82,0:19:10.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過狀態不怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:21.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一起來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.29,0:19:23.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.89,0:19:30.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我們大家都很清楚你的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.78,0:19:34.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原紮夫特紅衣菁英 克魯澤隊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.71,0:19:38.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在戰爭中期擊落了被稱為最強的Strike
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:42.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其後被調到國防委員會直屬特務部隊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.39,0:19:48.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZGMF-X09A Justice的機師
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.59,0:19:50.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭·薩拉對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.83,0:19:53.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不清楚他父親的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.34,0:19:57.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但他是我們的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.21,0:20:00.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,包括雅金·多杜維戰時的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.67,0:20:03.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.99,0:20:07.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說他射擊的本領也相當高超
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:19.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,做個示範吧 其實我不太擅長
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.66,0:20:45.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,用的同一把槍 為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:49.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是槍的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.43,0:20:53.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你在扣扳機的瞬間有扭手腕的習慣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.84,0:20:55.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以彈道會散
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.52,0:20:57.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.88,0:21:03.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過只是射擊拿手也沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:06.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒那回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.55,0:21:09.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了保護自己和同伴不受敵人傷害是必須的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:14.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵人...是指誰呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:19.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,密涅瓦似乎要去奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:29.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你又要回到奧布嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.05,0:21:31.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:33.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.95,0:21:38.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你在那裏有什麼可做的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.76,0:21:48.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,暴風雨要來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.68,0:21:51.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.43,0:23:27.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,構築的道路漫長
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.95,0:23:30.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但崩潰只需一瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.49,0:23:31.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.23,0:23:34.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但即便陷入痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.31,0:23:36.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,時光依然流逝 道路交錯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.69,0:23:40.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這相逢和別離帶來的是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.74,0:23:44.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.93,0:23:45.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,交叉點
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.73,0:23:49.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向霧中的大海前进 密涅瓦
